Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 17:04:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] fix(conference): make leave hangup independent from
 coordinator SDP wait

P0 session-close (HANGUP/GROUP_LEAVE) must not wait on SDP setDescription or PEER_EDGE_READY.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
